Morning, Mei. While you slept, your 5 agents
kept working — and Chaperone kept watch.

2
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:10,670
6 risky actions stopped,
before anything left the studio.

3
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:14,930
A client list, a confidential summary —
none of it went out.

4
00:00:16,747 --> 00:00:22,390
4 things need your yes.
10,260 Singapore dollars, waiting on you.

5
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:26,250
Most of it,
unpaid invoices an agent wanted to delete.

6
00:00:29,213 --> 00:00:31,810
Every decision quotes the exact line
in your files.

7
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:36,810
1 tap shows you why — what the agent
claimed, and what's actually on file.

8
00:00:38,924 --> 00:00:42,730
Approve or deny in 1 click.
Nothing moves without you.

9
00:00:43,872 --> 00:00:48,030
15 routine jobs done cleanly.
30 out of 30 checks passed.

10
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,750
19 rules, 0 dependencies.

11
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:57,420
Chaperone. Every number traces to a file.
Have a good day, Mei.

